{"id":"huraca_n","lemma":"huracán","pos":"noun","rank":4157,"glosses":["hurricane"],"ipa":"/uɾaˈkan/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"huracanes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-hurac%C3%A1n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Pronto vendrá un huracán.","en":"A hurricane's coming soon.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/770070","words":[{"g":"prompt, on time"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"A pesar del huracán el barco llegó al puerto.","en":"In spite of the hurricane, the ship reached port.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/768042","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"to weigh"},{"g":"of the"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"boat"},{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"port, harbour"}]},{"text":"Los huracanes son tempestades violentas.","en":"Hurricanes are violent storms.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642074","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"tempest, storm","l":"tempestad"},{"g":"violent","l":"violento"}]},{"text":"Su casa estaba arruinada después del huracán.","en":"After the hurricane, their house was a wreck.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"ruined","l":"arruinado"},{"g":"later"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"Los huracanes son tormentas violentas.","en":"Hurricanes are violent storms.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642075","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"storm","l":"tormenta"},{"g":"violent","l":"violento"}]}]}